.TH TOOL-RUNNER 1 "October 2026" "tsc-content-manager 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tool-runner \- Unified CLI runner for Train Simulator Classic Content Manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tool-runner
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIARGUMENTS\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBtool-runner\fR is the centralized command-line launcher and dispatcher for Train Simulator Classic (TSC) Content Manager tools.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version information and exit.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBserz-tag-detector\fR
Detects and analyzes SERZ tags in binary files.
.SH SEE ALSO
Full documentation available at <https://github.com/oberon-oss/tsc-content-manager>.
.SH AUTHOR
TigerLilly64 <info@oberon-oss.eu>
